<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Custody refers to the responsibility, control, and safekeeping of an asset, person, or legal entity. It involves both physical possession and legal authority over something or someone."@en .
